From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sarol263@student.otago.ac.nz>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:17:07 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 23/83] Plutonium: the switcher: shell pages, fullscreen
 windows, backup terminal and browser

The Super+Tab overlay becomes a sidebar (shells over windows and tabs) and a
page for the selected item: shell status and management, a window's shells,
snapshot and details, group toggles. Exo's EmbeddedWindows::Present() shows a
window fullscreen above every shell while elements keep it (EXO-PRESENT).
Backup terminal (the helper's page) and browser (Chrome's), and launching a
desktop app fullscreen through the helper's socket.
